    "volume": 1,
    "arabicText": "مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ",
    "englishText": "Muhammad—may Allah send blessings to him and his Household."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "volume": 1,
    "arabicText": "يَا أَبَا ٱلْقَاسِمِ",
    "englishText": "O Abu’l-Qasim!"
