    "englishText": "and through my love for you and my seeking nearness to you do I hope for salvation from Allah."
  },
  {
    "id": 164,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "volume": 1,
    "arabicText": "فَكُونُوا عِنْدَ ٱللَّهِ رَجَائِي",
    "englishText": "So, be my hope before Allah."
  },
