    "englishText": "and may Allah curse the enemies of Allah; those who wronged you,"
  },
  {
    "id": 168,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "volume": 1,
    "arabicText": "مِنَ ٱلاوَّلِينَ وَٱلآخِرِينَ",
    "englishText": "from the past and the last generations."
